# Prefix: Backport, Fork, Docs, Release, or Revert.
# Subject: imperative, under 72 characters, no trailing period.
#
# Blank line, then the body wrapped at 72. Say why the bug matters, what the
# fix does, and what was adapted for this branch. Do not narrate the diff.
#
# Backport commits record the test that was run:
#
#   Test: ext/foo/tests/bug12345.phpt (new)
#
# and finish with one trailer per line:
#
#   CVE: CVE-YYYY-NNNNN
#   Upstream: <full 40-character SHA>
#   Advisory: <optional advisory URL>
#
# Fork and Docs commits need no trailers.
# See AGENTS.md for the full convention.